  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Natural Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cream Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A buttery cream bronzer infused with ceramides, peptides, and a trio of butters that melts effortlessly into the skin for a natural, sunkissed finish.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Coverage: </strong>Medium</p><p><strong><br>Finish: </strong>Natural</p><p><strong><br>Formulation: </strong>Balm</p><p><strong><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong>- Soft-Set Complex: Allows the formula to blend effortlessly before setting to a natural finish.</p><p>- Trio of Butters (Shea, Mango Seed, and Illipe): Create a creamy and hydrating texture.</p><p>- Ceramides and Peptides: Support natural hydration and strengthen the skin’s moisture barrier.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> This product is vegan and cruelty-free.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Using a brush, sponge, or your fingertips, apply where the sun naturally hits your face&mdash;cheekbones, the bridge of the nose, and forehead.<br>-Pro Tip: Swirl, tap, and blend with The Bronzer Brush.<br>-Layer for a more defined, sculpted look.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Soft-Set Complex: Allows the formula to blend effortlessly before setting to a natural finish.<br>-Trio of Butters (Shea, Mango Seed, and Illipe): Create a creamy and hydrating texture.<br>-Ceramides and Peptides: Support natural hydration and strengthen the skin&rsquo;s moisture barrier.<br><br>Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Silica, Diisostearyl Malate, C10-18 Triglycerides, Polyglyceryl-2 Triisostearate, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Wax, Polyhydroxystearic Acid, Pentaerythrityl Adipate/Caprate/Caprylate/Heptanoate, Diisostearoyl Polyglyceryl-3 Dimer Dilinoleate, Octyldodecanol, Stearalkonium Hectorite, Tribehenin, Caprylic/Capric/Myristic/Stearic Triglyceride, Glyceryl Tribehenate/Isostearate/Eicosandioate, Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea) Butter, Mangifera Indica (Mango) Seed Butter, Shorea Stenoptera Seed Butter, Ceramide Np, Tocopherol, Methyl Glucose Sesquistearate, Silica Silylate, Caprylyl Glycol, Propylene Carbonate, Glyceryl Caprylate, Cetyl Ethylhexanoate, Limnanthes Alba (Meadowfoam) Seed Oil, Glyceryl Behenate, Hydrolyzed Sodium Hyaluronate, Polyglyceryl-3 Laurate, Water/Aqua/Eau, Acetyl Hexapeptide-8, May Contain/Peut Contenir (+/-), Iron Oxides (Ci 77492), Titanium Dioxide (Ci 77891), Iron Oxides (Ci 77499), Iron Oxides (Ci 77491).<br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change. Please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
